      "label": "champ_0270_select_c",
      "hash64": "58F20EF41C7F90BF",
      "text": "The Treasure Eatery",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "champ_0270_rival_answer_a01",
      "hash64": "D41EE9F3AD4C6109",
      "text": "Haha! Our beach out back, huh? Yeah, the place\\nwhere we had our first battle might work.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "champ_0270_rival_answer_a02",
      "hash64": "D41EE6F3AD4C5BF0",
      "text": "But on the other hand, to me it’s just kind of...\\nmy backyard, y’know? A little ordinary.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "champ_0270_rival_answer_a03",
      "hash64": "D41EE7F3AD4C5DA3",
      "text": "Anyplace else come to mind?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "champ_0270_chairman_answer_c01",
      "hash64": "4865105BA35B4C64",
      "text": "The Treasure Eatery? Is it significant to the two of\\nyou somehow?[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "champ_0270_chairman_answer_c02",
      "hash64": "4865135BA35B517D",
      "text": "Ah, are you thinking of it ’cause it’s got the\\nMedali Gym’s battle court?\\c\\nI guess it does bring back memories...of Larry...[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 126,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "champ_0270_chairman_answer_c03",
      "hash64": "4865125BA35B4FCA",
      "text": "Larry may not appreciate the surprise visit.\\c\\nIf you’ve any other suitable places in mind, would\\nyou prioritize them instead, please?[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "champ_0270_rival_18",
      "hash64": "0D45A1CEA0DE43CD",
      "text": "Mesagoza? Oooh, good call! The place where we\\nset out on our journey![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "champ_0270_rival_19",
      "hash64": "0D45A0CEA0DE421A",
      "text": "That reminds me, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]...\\c\\nRemember back when Director Clavell explained\\nthe [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Treasure Hunt[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]? Y’know how he told us to go\\r\\nin search of our own treasure?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
